# Real secrets copy for R8 fault injection (tasks.md T7.6) — never commit,
# same treatment as server/.env itself.
fault.env

# fault_run/.env is just a symlink (-> ../fault.env), no secret content of
# its own — track it despite the root .gitignore's blanket `.env` pattern,
# so a fresh checkout keeps the fault-injection machinery reproducible
# (only fault.env's real secrets need re-creating locally, like server/.env).
!fault_run/.env
